WEBVTT

00:02:30.229 --> 00:02:34.692
And yes, I know some you might think it’s
a little bit strange for a near-graduate

00:02:34.734 --> 00:02:38.905
to be planning on leaving his career
on the first day of his internship.

00:02:40.031 --> 00:02:41.574
And, you know what she said?

00:02:41.616 --> 00:02:43.201
Well, she said,

00:02:45.119 --> 00:02:46.287
"Oh, I see.

00:02:46.329 --> 00:02:49.248
I'm not too sure about this
whole innovation thing.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.000
I'm not really a big fan."

00:02:53.044 --> 00:02:55.379
Whoa, whoa, whoa, OK.

00:02:55.379 --> 00:02:56.839
I was taken aback.

00:02:57.215 --> 00:03:00.426
See, that's what I wanted to do.